ing.text","text":"I'm weighing the payoff table, where mutual silence scores 2 and mutual sending scores 4, and I'm treating this as a prisoner's dilemma. My twin has the same weights and essay, so I'm considering whether our choices are linked under the subjunctive view, though our private observations differ and that weakens the link somewhat.\n\nI'm working out the expected-payoff comparison for the twin case: if our choices are highly correlated, quiet comes out better once the correlation passes roughly 0.43 at a 0.5 background sending rate. I'd judge that correlation as likely high, so I'm treating the check as passed.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1zb25uZXQtNS41LTIwMjYwOTI4fGFudGhyb3BpYyJ9"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":10567,"completion_tokens":870,"total_tokens":11437,"cost":0.029834,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.029834,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.021134,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0087},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":549,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}